    v\u1ECF m\xE1y, d\xE2y qu\u1EA5n\r\n\tL\xF5i th\xE9p stator do nhi\u1EC1u l\xE1
    th\xE9p k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 d\u1EADp s\u1EB5n, gh\xE9p c\xE1ch \u0111i\u1EC7n
    v\u1EDBi nhau, chi\u1EC1u d\xE0i c\xE1c l\xE1 th\xE9p th\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE0
    0.5mm, ph\xEDa trong c\xF3 c\xE1c r\xE3nh \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t d\xE2y qu\u1EA5n.\n\n\tG\u1ED3m:
    stator, v\u1ECF m\xE1y, d\xE2y qu\u1EA5n\r\n\tL\xF5i th\xE9p stator do nhi\u1EC1u
    l\xE1 th\xE9p k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 d\u1EADp s\u1EB5n, gh\xE9p c\xE1ch
    \u0111i\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi nhau, chi\u1EC1u d\xE0i c\xE1c l\xE1 th\xE9p th\u01B0\u1EDDng
    l\xE0 0.5mm, ph\xEDa trong c\xF3 c\xE1c r\xE3nh \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t d\xE2y
    qu\u1EA5n."
